      "id": "claim_5d059b66f80a4646b33bd6501bdd4369",
      "statement": "The agent service is the runtime orchestrator for UnderCover's claim work and improvement work: it owns the FastAPI API, keeps a shared checkpoint pool open, starts dispatches and evaluations as background runs, and coordinates improvement rounds that pause for human approval and later resume.",
