      "id": "claim_d68cdbdb1c01468eb21ff722753f79c3",
      "statement": "Dispatches and evaluations share the same background execution path: the API handlers validate input, create a backend run, and enqueue `work_in_background()`, which names the run, invokes `work_run()`, logs uncaught failures, stops backend runs on error, and always releases the work gate.",
