      "id": "claim_b8864cf185204ccf86a4d7e7769b3770",
      "statement": "A dispatch works claims in the backend queue in submission order, restricted to claims in `waiting` or `in_progress`, and excludes claims currently marked as resuming after sign-off; an evaluation instead uses the run's preselected claim list.",
