      "statement": "The service exposes `/api/claims/{claim_id}/resume` to pick up a signed-off claim without waiting; it only accepts a claim that is `in_progress` and has `signed_off_by`, marks the claim as resuming, and schedules a background carry-on using a fresh claim graph.",
